  "description": "Choi Jin is the perfect director, possessing intelligence, good looks, and undeniable sex appeal. But he has a little secret: he's a master of pillow talk! Having climbed his way up to become a director at AJ Group through his pillow business, he accidentally sleeps with Kang Haram, an innocent-looking new employee, during a company dinner. Since it was just a one-night mistake with nothing to gain from it, Jin intends to quietly have his fun and then dump Haram. However, it turns out that Haram is actually the biological grandson of AJ Group's chairman...?! Well, that changes everything. I absolutely have to make him mine! Will Choi Jin's pillow business(?) finally pay off?\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/DontgoIsa)",
